<view class="page"><view class="title">问懂一个词</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">加载中…</view><view wx:if="{{word}}" class="panel"><view class="title">{{word}}</view><view class="line">{{definition}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!available}}" class="notice">问答服务尚未接入。可以写好问题并复制；当前不会发送网络请求。</view><view class="chips"><view class="chip" data-question="How is this word different from its closest synonyms?" bindtap="preset">近义词区别</view><view class="chip" data-question="When would this word sound too formal?" bindtap="preset">适用场合</view><view class="chip" data-question="Could you give me an everyday example of this meaning?" bindtap="preset">举个例子</view></view><textarea disabled="{{sending}}" maxlength="1000" value="{{question}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="输入你的问题，支持中英文"/><view class="muted">{{question.length}} / 1000 · 发送时仅提交当前问题、词头与所选英文词义。</view><button wx:if="{{available}}" class="primary" disabled="{{sending || loading}}" bindtap="submit">{{sending ? '正在回答…' : '发送问题'}}</button><button disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="copy">复制问题与词义</button><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</view><view wx:if="{{answer}}" class="panel"><view class="muted">模型解释 · 不属于词典原文</view><text class="answer" selectable>{{answer}}</text><button wx:if="{{chinese}}" bindtap="toggle">{{showChinese ? '隐藏中文' : '显示中文'}}</button><view wx:if="{{showChinese}}" class="line">{{chinese}}</view><view wx:for="{{sources}}" wx:key="url" class="line small" selectable>{{item.title}}：{{item.url}}</view></view></view>
